Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.22,0:01:43.00,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,The Honmas take such good care \Nof their garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.86,0:01:47.23,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,I haven't ridden the train in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.71,0:01:53.85,Italics Top,Announcer,0,0,0,,The doors are closing. Please stand clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.02,0:02:13.71,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,Sh-She startled me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.26,0:02:32.28,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,Girls these days \Nsure wear their skirts short.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.69,0:02:34.51,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,Barely covers anything.
