Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.89,0:02:41.77,Italics,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.16,0:02:48.15,Italics,Kinme,0,0,0,,Y-You can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.18,0:02:53.15,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.59,0:02:58.05,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,You can't yank on a shirt like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.83,0:03:06.03,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,Oh, dear. I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.03,0:03:07.58,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Aw, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.58,0:03:10.38,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Well, this sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.84,0:03:18.20,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,I'll just go like this from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.20,0:03:19.97,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,No, don't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.35,0:03:26.29,Italics Top,Announcer,0,0,0,,Next stop is Kinomiya. Kinomiya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.50,0:03:33.02,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,I mean, is this free?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.02,0:03:35.74,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Of course. You don't owe me anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.21,0:03:39.54,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I just can't ignore this sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.70,0:03:45.19,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I run a cleaning business \Nnear the station here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.19,0:03:47.01,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,My name is Kinme Wakana.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.73,0:03:51.49,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.29,0:03:53.77,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,And what is your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.29,0:03:56.05,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,It's Wakasagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.05,0:03:57.91,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Wakasagi Kuriru.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.51,0:04:01.90,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,But I mean, what are you doing outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.90,0:04:03.64,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh? Outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.64,0:04:08.52,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Cause, like, don't cleaners \Nwork inside a shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.52,0:04:16.57,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh. Yes, I do most of my work at the shop,\Nbut I also have many elderly customers,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.57,0:04:20.16,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,so I often go out \Nfor pick-ups and deliveries.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.16,0:04:23.95,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It's just a small, independent business, \Nbut in keeping with our motto,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.95,0:04:29.42,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,"Local Cleaning with a Heart," I like to \Ngo out of my way for the customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.99,0:04:31.69,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Was that a sales pitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.69,0:04:32.34,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.34,0:04:34.85,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Just talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.92,0:04:39.68,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,There. Repairs complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.51,0:04:44.18,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Awesome! Just like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.77,0:04:48.18,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,You're so ladylike! You must\Nhave tons of boyfriends, Kinme-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.18,0:04:51.02,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, no, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.02,0:04:55.14,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,From now on, try to treat \Nyour clothes with more care, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.14,0:04:59.81,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I'm not really sure \Nwhat to do with them, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.74,0:05:06.67,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,I live with my brother, and we don't have \Nanyone around to fix things for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.20,0:05:11.48,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,There's shirts all around the apartment \Nwith missing buttons and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.66,0:05:16.79,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,If it's all right with you, why don't I \Nstop by your home right now
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.79,0:05:19.37,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,and see what kind of condition \Nyour clothes are in?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.37,0:05:20.22,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.61,0:05:24.51,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, but if this is a bad time, \Nthat's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.51,0:05:27.18,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,I mean, like, I don't really mind, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.18,0:05:28.22,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,But?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.48,0:05:31.23,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Right now, the place is kind of...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.61,0:05:42.52,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Go on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.99,0:05:51.42,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Oh, my phone charger's lying \Naround there somewhere, so watch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.87,0:05:54.04,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Those things can really hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.47,0:05:57.71,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,There are dirty clothes thrown everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.71,0:06:00.24,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,How often do you usually do laundry?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.24,0:06:07.30,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Well, house rules say we each gotta \Ndo our own, but it's such a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.30,0:06:09.31,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Maybe about three times a month?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.31,0:06:11.31,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.63,0:06:15.69,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,Maybe I should help her \Nclean house as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.47,0:06:19.26,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.15,0:06:23.92,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,No, stop spraying! \NYou shouldn't use that so recklessly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.92,0:06:24.82,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Huh?
