Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.14,0:06:29.56,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,You sprayed that all over your uniform\N on the train too, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.04,0:06:33.33,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,But I mean, sweaty-smelling \Nclothes are gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.33,0:06:40.24,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes, but you see, it's very common \Nto use sprays like that incorrectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.24,0:06:41.84,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,What am I doing wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.84,0:06:47.09,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an9\c&H606B60&\3c&H85E5E2&\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\fs16\b1\pos(629,16)}With Green Tea Extract\NWorks for 48 Hours!
