Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.84,0:06:47.09,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an9\c&HA2736F&\3c&HF1F4F9&\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\fs18\b1\pos(629,109)}Antibacterial\NDeodorant
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.31,0:06:47.09,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I realize this sort of antibacterial \Ndeodorant is common and convenient,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.48,0:06:52.50,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,but if you spray a fabric \Nwhen it still has a sweat stain on it,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.50,0:06:56.98,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,the spray liquid could make \Nthe stain spread into a circular shape
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.98,0:06:59.22,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,and set into the fabric.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.98,0:07:04.92,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,The smell may go away, but stains \Nwill keep accumulating on the fabric.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.92,0:07:10.87,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,If you use sprays like that regularly, \Nyou need to be really, {\i1}really{\i0} careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.15,0:07:13.88,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Consider it a personal request from Kinme!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.62,0:07:17.66,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Oh. Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.14,0:07:21.62,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,For daily care of your uniform,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.62,0:07:25.56,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,you should hang your skirt\N on a skirt hanger and brush it instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.46,0:07:31.67,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,One benefit of brushing is that it gets \Nrid of dirt and dust stuck to the fabric.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.67,0:07:36.30,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Then it straightens out all \Nthe little fibers that are so hard to see,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.30,0:07:37.60,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,which also helps.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.97,0:07:43.34,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,If you don't have a brush, it's fine \Nto use a lint roller or even packing tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.53,0:07:46.89,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Packing tape works for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.89,0:07:51.96,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I still think it is best to \Nwash occasionally, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.96,0:07:57.29,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Check the care labels to see which of \Nyour garments are washable at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.29,0:08:02.17,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Wait, they tell you? But I mean, \Nwhat is a care label anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.17,0:08:04.80,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\fnArial\fs20\pos(332,108)\c&H808282&\3c&HD8D8D8&\frz15.99}Materials
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.17,0:08:04.80,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\fnArial\fs14\c&H808282&\3c&HD8D8D8&\pos(363,138)\frz16.63}Polyester\N{\an8\shad0\fnArial\fs14\c&H808282&\3c&HD8D8D8&\frz16.63\pos(379,150)}Wool
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.17,0:08:04.80,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,One of these. By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.80,0:08:12.05,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(496,69)\shad0\b1\3c&HD99E69&\c&HFFFFFF&\fad(1,851)}New Symbols
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.80,0:08:11.80,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fs18\shad0\fsp3\c&H555963&\3c&HFCFFFF&\blur2\bord3\pos(322,20)\fad(1,851)}Do Not Wash
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.80,0:08:11.80,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fs17\shad0\fsp3\c&H555963&\3c&HFCFFFF&\blur2\bord3\pos(324,114)\fad(1,851)}Do Not Dry Clean
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.80,0:08:11.80,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fs19\shad0\fsp3\c&H555963&\3c&HFCFFFF&\blur2\bord3\pos(323,223)\fad(1,851)}Do Not Wet Wash
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.13,0:08:10.00,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,if you see any of these symbols, \Nit means you cannot wash it at home,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.00,0:08:12.34,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,so please take those items \Nto the cleaners.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.01,0:08:16.68,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(496,69)\shad0\b1\3c&H5651E1&\c&HFFFFFF&\fad(316,1)}Old Symbols
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.85,0:08:16.68,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fs16\shad0\c&H555963&\3c&HFCFFFF&\blur2\bord3\pos(322,20)\fad(316,1)}Do Not Wash in Water
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.85,0:08:16.68,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fs15\shad0\c&H555963&\3c&HFCFFFF&\blur2\bord3\fad(316,1)\fsp3\pos(323,116)}Cannot Dry Clean
Dialogue: 1,0:08:13.35,0:08:16.68,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(351,1)\an2\fnVerdana\fs16\shad0\c&H4D5458&\3c&HFCFFFC&\pos(320,250)}* Cleaning symbols were updated \Nin December 2016.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:12.92,0:08:16.68,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Older clothes will have \Nthe old versions of the symbols.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.68,0:08:22.19,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\fnArial\fs40\c&H697281&\3c&HECECEC&\move(330,-31,184,15,0,5488)\frz17.05}Materials
