Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.68,0:08:22.19,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\fnArial\fs24\c&H697281&\3c&HECECEC&\frz17.81\move(364,232,203,292,24,5488)}Chlorine\NBleach
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.68,0:08:22.19,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\fnArial\fs24\c&H697281&\3c&HECECEC&\frz17.81\move(490,154,328,213,24,5488)}Medium
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.68,0:08:22.19,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\fnArial\fs24\c&H697281&\3c&HECECEC&\frz17.81\move(606,87,443,146,24,5488)}Dry
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.68,0:08:22.19,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\fnArial\fs20\c&H697281&\3c&HECECEC&\frz17.81\move(652,180,481,241,24,5446)}Petroleum-based
Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.68,0:08:19.30,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes, these are the old symbols.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:19.30,0:08:22.19,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Huh, they are kinda different.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.51,0:08:24.92,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,I'd never even looked \Nat those things before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.27,0:08:31.74,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,But I mean, is it okay \Nto be telling me all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.74,0:08:33.45,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh? Why wouldn't it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.45,0:08:37.20,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\fnArial\fs40\c&H646A75&\3c&HE2E2E6&\frz17.05\pos(362,-2)\bord0}Materials
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.45,0:08:37.20,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\fnArial\fs30\c&H646A75&\3c&HE2E2E6&\frz17.81\pos(467,94)\bord0}Polyester
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.45,0:08:37.20,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\fnArial\fs30\c&H646A75&\3c&HE2E2E6&\frz17.81\pos(484,140)\bord0}Rayon
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.45,0:08:37.20,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\fnArial\fs24\c&H697281&\3c&HD3D3D3&\frz17.81\pos(207,290)}Low
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.45,0:08:37.20,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\fnArial\fs24\c&H697281&\3c&HD3D3D3&\frz17.81\pos(394,307)}Chlorine\NBleach
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.45,0:08:37.20,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\fnArial\fs24\c&H646A75&\3c&HD3D3D3&\frz17.81\pos(536,214)}Medium
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.45,0:08:37.20,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Well, isn't it something \Nlike a trade secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.62,0:08:41.00,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,If everyone knew how to \Ntake care of their own clothes,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.00,0:08:43.54,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,they wouldn't go to your shop as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.09,0:08:46.27,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,And then you'd lose out, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.27,0:08:47.59,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.94,0:08:52.93,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'd be thrilled if everyone \Ntook better care of their clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.72,0:08:59.59,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Wow. You've got, like, maxed out \Ncleaning skills. You'd be such a catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.59,0:09:00.23,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.52,0:09:04.98,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,W-Well, could you show me \Nyour clothes with missing buttons?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.27,0:09:08.99,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,I think this is one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.99,0:09:13.26,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Wow. This one appears to be \Nmissing four buttons.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.26,0:09:14.55,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.55,0:09:19.76,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,And it's winter wear. I'd recommend \Nthat you got this cleaned as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.76,0:09:21.00,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Maybe I should.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.59,0:09:27.87,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,However, if you don't mind me saying so, \Nperhaps we could clean your room first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.09,0:09:42.81,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Get this. She didn't say, "Good morning." \NShe said, "Help me get these pajamas off."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.17,0:09:46.57,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Treating her little brother like a servant\Nor something. Can you believe it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.29,0:09:50.07,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,So what did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.37,0:09:52.70,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,I helped her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.03,0:09:54.68,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,You did, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.64,0:10:00.95,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,And at first, we were \Ntaking turns cooking each day,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.95,0:10:04.78,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,but recently she's been making me \Ndo {\i1}all{\i0} the cooking myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.78,0:10:07.96,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Hmm. So who's cooking tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.45,0:10:09.87,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,I guess I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.87,0:10:11.44,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,You are, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.91,0:10:17.46,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Still, your big sis sure is \Na hit with the guys at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.46,0:10:21.98,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Yeah, 'cause none of them see \Nwhat she's like on the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.37,0:10:26.06,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,And I mean, we're twins and were \Nbasically born at the same time,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.06,0:10:27.96,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,so why does she always \Nact like she's older?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.15,0:10:30.97,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Yeah, you were saying that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.61,0:10:37.15,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Well, I actually don't care \Nthat she's older,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.49,0:10:41.51,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,but is it too much to ask for some \Nbig-sisterly attributes at least?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.51,0:10:43.25,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Sisterly attributes, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.60,0:10:48.25,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Yeah! Like being nice and reliable \Nand worshiping her brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.53,0:10:51.07,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Sounds like some kind of fantasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.07,0:10:52.40,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Of course it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.13,0:10:57.88,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Huh? I guess she's already home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.55,0:11:00.39,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.02,0:11:03.64,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, welcome home, Moruda-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.24,0:11:11.15,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Uh, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.36,0:11:13.02,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Do I stick it in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.02,0:11:15.15,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Uh, that actually goes here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.81,0:11:19.19,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes, like that. Just go very slowly, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.10,0:11:23.17,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,My name is Kinme Wakana.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.17,0:11:26.15,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Your sister and I sort of \Nbecame friends at the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.15,0:11:28.18,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I hope you don't mind me being here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.18,0:11:29.17,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Uh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.45,0:11:35.92,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Right now we're, well, washing your \Nsister's clothes along with some of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.31,0:11:37.76,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Is that all right with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.24,0:11:39.80,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Yeah, s'all right with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.12,0:11:44.30,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Wait, is that Kyusho-kun? \NAre you boys friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.30,0:11:47.33,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Um, what are you doing here, Kinme-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.69,0:11:50.18,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Bro, bro, bro, wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.18,0:11:56.22,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,How the hell did you get to meet \Nmy true big sister before I did?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.22,0:11:59.49,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,For some reason, I think it'd be \Na little hard to explain right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.49,0:12:00.49,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Can we save it for later?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.30,0:12:02.54,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,True sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.91,0:12:03.88,Default - Top,Moruda,0,0,0,,You'd better tell me later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.54,0:12:04.68,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Pay no attention to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.95,0:12:10.96,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\fs22\c&HC4C480&\3c&HFBFFFE&\an7\frz9.132\pos(419,24)}Wash {\c&0000000&}It All Away
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.96,0:12:15.96,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\fs22\c&HC4C480&\3c&HFBFFFE&\an7\frz9.132\pos(416,243)}Wash {\c&0000000&}It All Away
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.76,0:12:20.47,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\b1\fnArial\fad(601,1)\shad0\c&H00B4E4&\3c&H0F6896&}Kinme Cleaning
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.06,0:12:26.44,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.44,0:12:28.35,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Well, hello, Nairo-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.35,0:12:29.69,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.69,0:12:32.47,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Would you please wash these for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.47,0:12:33.86,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.15,0:12:38.37,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Um, um... how late are you open today?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.37,0:12:39.36,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.66,0:12:43.12,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, it's almost closing time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.51,0:12:46.24,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It looks like you're my last customer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.03,0:12:47.80,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.38,0:12:57.13,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh? What are those?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.43,0:13:02.92,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Aha! Have you been practicing \Ndrumming for the Kogashi Festival?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.92,0:13:06.64,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Yes! I have rehearsal right after this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.07,0:13:08.82,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,And these are my very own drumsticks!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.82,0:13:11.02,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Wow. They're very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.35,0:13:13.94,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,And the festival is\N right around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.94,0:13:19.07,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I went last year and saw all the floats.\N They were really impressive!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.07,0:13:23.43,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Yes! This year I get to ride the float \Nfor Grandmother's Asama district
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.43,0:13:25.41,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,and play the drum!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.41,0:13:28.45,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.67,0:13:41.06,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,So I would really like you to come \Nwith me tonight and watch our practice!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.06,0:13:46.98,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh? Th-Thank you for the invitation, \Nbut I think I'd just get in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.98,0:13:49.18,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It's not my district, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.50,0:13:51.68,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,That's totally okay, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.68,0:13:58.11,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,I'd like you to see how much my drumming\N improved over the last two weeks!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.11,0:14:01.95,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Okay? Okay? Please come and watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.96,0:14:15.40,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,All right, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.21,0:14:19.01,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,We always hold practice over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.01,0:14:20.21,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.21,0:14:23.41,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,It's Kinme-san! Whatcha up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.41,0:14:26.04,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,My daughter invited her \Nto come watch practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.04,0:14:28.54,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I hope that's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.54,0:14:30.72,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,It's good, it's good. Stay and watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.72,0:14:33.38,Default,Participant,0,0,0,,Everything's set up now, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.38,0:14:36.32,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Sweet! Then let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.73,0:14:41.14,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Like it or not, \Nwe've only got two days left,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.14,0:14:42.98,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,so let's give it our best shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.98,0:14:44.36,Default,All,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.36,0:14:46.34,Default,All,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.34,0:14:51.02,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I see Ishimochi-san is the organizer for\N Asama's Kogashi Festival activities.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.02,0:14:54.37,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,Yes. There are always many floats \Ncompeting from different districts,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.37,0:14:58.52,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,so she's out here every day,\Ndoing her best to keep everyone motivated.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.37,0:14:56.53,Default - Top,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,We'll start as soon as you're ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.28,0:15:01.34,Default - Top,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Let's fix up the parts we flubbed \Nyesterday and power through to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.50,0:15:04.27,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I wonder if the inn does all right \Nwithout her there to serve dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.27,0:15:05.26,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.26,0:15:08.26,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fs24\an8\fnArial\c&H6E675B&\3c&HF7EEDF&}Guesthouse Inn Ishimochi
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.77,0:15:14.73,Default,Customer,0,0,0,,Hey, son. Can I get seconds?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.73,0:15:15.67,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Comin' up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.40,0:15:23.90,Default,All,0,0,0,,Ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.90,0:15:25.11,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Tam, tam.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.53,0:15:28.71,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Tam, tam.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.73,0:15:31.91,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Tam, tam.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.22,0:15:37.35,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Looking good. \NRemember to get those sticks up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.62,0:15:39.86,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Tam, ta-ta-tam.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.86,0:15:41.68,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Tam, tam, tam.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.20,0:15:48.80,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,We actually moved here \Nfrom Tokyo just this past spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.95,0:15:48.29,Default - Top,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Tam, tam. Tam.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.80,0:15:50.61,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.27,0:15:53.89,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,Our house is in a district in the hills,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.89,0:15:57.74,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,but since Nairo's grandmother lives \Ndown here, they let her participate
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.74,0:16:00.04,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,in this district's festival activities.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.94,0:16:02.66,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.66,0:16:06.98,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I can see why she would be so excited \Nabout being in her first festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.98,0:16:10.32,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,Until now, she's only been able to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.10,0:16:28.00,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,Did you ever drum in the festival \Nwhen you were younger, Kinme-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.00,0:16:32.86,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,No, I've only been here\Nfor about two years or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.86,0:16:35.85,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,Oh, so this isn't your hometown?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.85,0:16:37.52,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,Where are you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.31,0:16:39.86,Default - Top,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Okay, stop! Once more from the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.52,0:16:39.86,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Um, actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.86,0:16:41.48,Default - Top,Moruda,0,0,0,,Sup!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.48,0:16:44.86,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Well, well. So you two \Nfinally decided to show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.86,0:16:47.30,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Come on and lend us a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.30,0:16:50.76,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Nah, I mean, we're just \Non our way back from the store.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.76,0:16:53.64,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Why not? Kyu will be showing up soon too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.64,0:16:57.00,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,No, I really have to get home. \NSorry, gotta pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.00,0:17:00.71,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,We've also got \Na real looker with us today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.71,0:17:01.88,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.88,0:17:04.79,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Oh, it's the cleaning lady from before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.79,0:17:05.76,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Sup!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.76,0:17:08.84,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Kinme-san! Wow, what a coincidence!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.84,0:17:10.70,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Were you doing some shopping together?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.70,0:17:13.89,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, yeah! Can't say \Nshe helped much, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.89,0:17:19.34,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, I guess you get to participate in \Nthe festival because you live so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.34,0:17:20.27,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.27,0:17:23.17,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,When the time comes, \NI'll be on top of that float!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.17,0:17:23.77,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.77,0:17:27.95,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh? Wow! I'm sure you'll do great!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.93,0:17:31.78,Italics,Moruda (M),0,0,0,,She's the one!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.78,0:17:36.37,Italics,Moruda (M),0,0,0,,The ideal big sister! She's a real angel!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.37,0:17:40.54,Italics,Kuriru (M),0,0,0,,Totally one of those oblivious devils \Nwho ends up leading all the guys on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.54,0:17:45.28,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right. It's about time \Nwe pull the festival clothes out again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.04,0:17:50.28,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Um, if it would help, \Nshall I go and get them for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.28,0:17:54.13,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Oh, you're a lifesaver! \NThanks so much, Kinme-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.13,0:17:56.25,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,We keep them stored \Nat the community center.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.25,0:17:58.06,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Community center?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.38,0:18:01.31,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,I'd be happy to show you where it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.31,0:18:05.44,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,What? But didn't you say \Nyou needed to get home?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.44,0:18:08.11,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Yeah, so he can start making dinner and—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.11,0:18:11.35,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,No, it's okay! Totally okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.35,0:18:13.28,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,They sure get along well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.20,0:18:15.91,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Okay, one more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.91,0:18:17.42,Default,All,0,0,0,,Ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.42,0:18:18.67,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Tam, tam!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.97,0:18:21.96,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Tam, tam!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.95,0:18:24.71,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Eyes on the drum!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.60,0:18:28.46,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,So you two don't rehearse with the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.71,0:18:32.97,sign_26631_341_Community_Center,text,0,0,0,,{\c&H83858C&}Community Center
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.46,0:18:32.97,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,No. Rehearsals are pretty much meant \Nfor kids in middle school or younger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.31,0:18:34.56,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Oh, it's right in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.29,0:18:39.56,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,In high school, you get to ride \Non top and hype up the crowd,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.56,0:18:42.14,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,so we basically just show up \Nand play it by ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.48,0:18:44.88,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Wait. What the hell are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.88,0:18:46.62,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Bodyguarding.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.88,0:18:46.01,Default - Top,Moruda,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.62,0:18:47.65,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Body?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.37,0:18:52.23,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Wow, this many people participate?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.23,0:18:55.29,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,There aren't that many people \Naround now, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.66,0:18:59.46,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Oh, and those are our parents \Nwhen they were in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.46,0:19:02.13,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,And that's Kyu-kun's mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.13,0:19:04.27,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh. They look like a wild bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.14,0:19:10.31,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I guess Kyusho-kun will be riding too. \NIn that case, I should probably go watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.31,0:19:13.78,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,You're gonna have a lot of \Ncompetition, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.78,0:19:14.30,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.05,0:19:19.00,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,He's got those rugged good looks, \Nbut he's also got a sweet side,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.00,0:19:21.80,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,so the girls have been \Ninto him since grade school.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.80,0:19:25.31,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,He gets tons of chocolate \Non Valentine's Day every year.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.58,0:19:27.15,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,And my brother gets zilch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.15,0:19:28.47,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Keep your mouth shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.06,0:19:32.04,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh. I guess that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.04,0:19:33.20,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.20,0:19:34.55,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Hmm? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.55,0:19:38.51,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh! I'm not saying that \NI see him that way, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.51,0:19:39.26,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.26,0:19:41.45,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,He's just the son of one of my regulars.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.45,0:19:45.49,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right! Kyu is no more \Nthan a customer to Kinme-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.49,0:19:47.94,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Why would you even think \Nthere's anything else going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.94,0:19:52.19,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Right, and you're a wannabe player \Nwho isn't even on Kinme-san's radar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.19,0:19:54.60,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,I'm not a player! I'm pure at heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.60,0:20:00.19,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Anyway, can we get the clothes out\N and go home? I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.19,0:20:01.72,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Quit complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.72,0:20:04.47,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,You could try helping for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.47,0:20:07.66,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Gah! What the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.30,0:20:13.23,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Eww. They're covered in moldy stains!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.62,0:20:15.48,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,How could this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.74,0:20:19.34,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It must be because of \Nthat leak in the ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.34,0:20:20.49,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Oh crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.49,0:20:24.26,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Like, aren't we screwed? \NThe festival is day after tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.26,0:20:28.51,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Let's just throw them all \Nin the washing machine and—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.51,0:20:29.75,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,No, don't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.01,0:20:33.25,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,If you don't clean the stains \Nand mold before washing,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.25,0:20:35.59,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I don't think you'll ever get them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.28,0:20:38.43,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Then what can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.18,0:20:45.04,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'll treat the stains \Nand then wash them all myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.18,0:20:47.54,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Will you make it in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.54,0:20:49.52,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Maybe if I stay up all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.52,0:20:52.52,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,All night? Will you be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.52,0:20:56.30,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'm used to pulling all-nighters \Nduring the spring busy season.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.00,0:21:02.03,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I know you need these garments \Nfor the festival, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.12,0:21:06.40,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,You can count on Kinme!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.79,0:21:09.44,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Damn, she's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.79,0:21:14.26,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,But I don't think we should make \NKinme-san do it all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.26,0:21:15.72,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Kyusho-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.05,0:21:20.19,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Hey, Kyu! You trying to insult \NKinme-san's cleaning skills?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.19,0:21:22.05,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,No, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.43,0:21:26.59,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,But it's our fault the outfits got dirty. \NWe didn't store them carefully enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.31,0:21:30.30,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,We need to take responsibility for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.81,0:21:32.88,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,So let's all help Kinme-san out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.60,0:21:40.99,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,We'll be done sooner,\N and it'll make things easier for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.32,0:21:44.07,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,I agree with Kyu-kun's suggestion!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.34,0:21:45.49,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Here, take a box.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.49,0:21:46.74,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.74,0:21:48.08,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,There's still more.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.08,0:21:49.52,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Fine. Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.07,0:21:51.71,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.71,0:21:54.80,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It actually did seem \Na little overwhelming.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.11,0:22:00.07,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Okay, everyone. Thank you for helping!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.76,0:22:02.89,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Now let's get these ready \Nfor the festival!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.81,0:22:14.77,Default,Credits,0,0,0,,{\an9\fad(353,354)\shad0\fnArial\fs10\bord1.5\c&H4A83BA&\3c&HF0FBFF&\b1\pos(443,268)}Translation:\NEditing and Typesetting:
