Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.98,0:23:39.98,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020201&\bord0\pos(305,159)}Episode {\c&H8A80CC&}5 {\c&H020201} I Have a {\c&HA49F43&}Feeling{\c&H020201&}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.85,0:23:38.68,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Next time is "I Have a Feeling..."
